    {
      "source_id": "hu:1430597",
      "source_url": "https://m.humoruniv.com/board/read.html?table=pds&number=1430597",
      "title": "한국과 일본에서 욕을 대차게 먹은 한국 ‘아줌마’",
      "body": "\n<p>\n\n</p><div><p>\n</p><div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:54eca6e26d17fe0845dbccb40ca15943178cedffe819a57fba9c33b70603fde2\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><p></p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:cafe99bcc7ceb9cc5fa799b7d1dccb54deb0bfc92f956688d7323911512175ba\"/></p><p> </p><p><b><span>한일커플（남:한국 / 녀:일본）에 대해 알아보자</span></b></p><p> </p><p><b><span>이 둘은 항상 같이 요리를 한다</span></b></p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:2f554cbedbe552853e04773e74223e79389e554243dac4b927b749a35cbea404\"/></p><p> </p><p><b><span>일본인 여친: 집안일이나 청소 많이 해줘요</span></b></p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:c10cf630bb6da1c7517bb5aed057dd8554353ddf7fd3bdb0ba59c3a92ecdb080\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:bb7a9117e8226545e1c2c4201ee238a8f38edcce51243a7d2c030f583a281ffa\"/></p><p> </p><p><b><span>일본인 여친: 아니 심지어 냉장고 청소를 해준다니까요, 그것도 매일</span></b> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:a1cbbd2df4d37da11fc160f6b9ebec71ba8c21c4b6752e7ea1ee9a6831597cc3\"/></p><p> </p><p><b><span>한국인 남친: 도와주는게 아니라 당연한거 아님?</span></b></p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:4dec41c4421f8d05b7ab8446d0675fb801a23ed909228bc48617712869941b72\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:4af6d7b7be323d66b77eb11ca7f6e37136b3b1f67ce0811438cd43eecd0b482b\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:1e3dea72483b237def3c38e38773cf373eb0b5fbb307a0319eb7f2c47e54a651\"/></p><p> </p><p><b><span>통역사 김씨 아줌마: 남자가 당연히 해야지 뭘 그런걸로 호들갑은 ㅉㅉ</span></b></p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:3cd2d3e2f5828708739002ded676e130cce15fefee39bcbaa945172ae5cbb92b\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:28702667e0d141dad2a26cf6e854ca83f719d2335d546e633ef2543fb675ee98\"/></p><p> </p><p><b><span>스태프: 그... 반박했다가 귀찮으니... 저희가 스미마셍</span></b></p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:56461a7df6d8f172c89e08758d7d89194830997b29fa8bf45fbd382ea4104f8b\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:d7cba52cb47e0ce6a2c5a487de2c33076e347547fb3d991758af00f18193fc37\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:b927db0cb6d1e975392bf23ee8b06873514cc2bcc094d83af53630263ccfcc7b\"/></p><p> </p><p>\n<span>\n\n</span> <img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:46d47d386a2dc1a741f6a2ef55b691b98ca07f997b10c71fe80df65d0f8b9f7d\"/></p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p><b><span>통역이 왜 사견을???</span></b></p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p></div>\n<p></p>\n",
